                                                "sense_id": "5bfc4473-d4ce-3066-ae67-22fb0529049a",
                                                "text": "With my mother's permission and blessings, I set off exultantly for Bombay, leaving my wife with a baby of a few months. But on arrival there, friends told my brother that the Indian Ocean was rough in June and July, and as this was my first voyage, I should not be allowed to sail until November."
